//
// `MATERIAL` and `POLY` are generated by `rust/_/gen_enums.py`; the rest is by hand.
// The C# file's commented-out C structs are not carried across.
//
// Marshalled structs (the ones with a `Struct` pattern) are `bytemuck::Pod` +
// `IStruct`. Their `POLY` fields (`SAVE_EPOLY.Type`) are the raw `i32`, since the
// generated `bitflags` type isn't `Pod`; `to` converts with `POLY::from_bits_retain`.
// C#'s `Vector3<ushort>`/`Vector3<short>` are glam's `U16Vec3`/`I16Vec3`.
//
// Value types (ADR 0003): `E_BONE` implements `Default` by hand because glam's
// `Quat::default()` is the identity, while C#'s `default(Quaternion)` is all
// zeros, and `CreateCedricData` relies on the zero (`QuatInit` is never set).
// C# classes that a second array points at (`E_BONE.OriginalGroup`) are clones;
// nothing changes them afterwards.
//
// `Quaternion.Inverse` is spelled out in `transformInverseVertexQuat`: glam's
// `Quat::inverse` is the conjugate, which is only the inverse of a unit quaternion.
// `Log.Info` is `openx_poly::log::Log::info`. `string.Equals(.., OrdinalIgnoreCase)` is
// `eq_ignore_ascii_case`.

